  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><p data-start=\"113\" data-end=\"340\" id=\"isPasted\"><strong data-start=\"113\" data-end=\"146\">About our brand and products:</strong><br data-start=\"146\" data-end=\"149\">MiGoals creates purpose-driven stationery and tools that help people get clear, stay focused, and take action. From diaries to goal planners, we empower you to dream big and make it happen.</p><p data-start=\"342\" data-end=\"510\"><strong data-start=\"342\" data-end=\"370\">What makes us different:</strong><br data-start=\"370\" data-end=\"373\">We blend design, motivation, and structure. MiGoals isn’t just stationery—it’s a movement built to help people turn goals into reality.</p><p data-start=\"512\" data-end=\"673\"><strong data-start=\"512\" data-end=\"540\">How affiliates can earn:</strong><br data-start=\"540\" data-end=\"543\">Earn commission on every sale you refer through your unique link. The more people you inspire to take action, the more you earn.</p><p data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"835\"><strong data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"697\">How to promote us:</strong><br data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"700\">Share MiGoals across social media, blogs, YouTube, or newsletters using lifestyle content, reviews, or your own goal-setting journey.</p><p data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"999\"><strong data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"859\">Other information:</strong><br data-start=\"859\" data-end=\"862\">We provide creative assets, exclusive offers, and early access to launches—helping you inspire your audience while growing your income.</p><p data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1128\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><br></p></div>",
